WEBVTT

00:04:58.874 --> 00:05:01.683
Engaging the greatness in others.

00:05:01.683 --> 00:05:03.889
And then they pretty much stopped.

00:05:03.889 --> 00:05:05.120
So I asked,

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.170
"Well, what about people

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.534
who understand your business,

00:05:09.534 --> 00:05:10.940
where it's going,

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.550
and their role in taking it there?

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.866
And what about people who are able

00:05:14.866 --> 00:05:17.375
to scan the external environment,

00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:20.176
identify risks and opportunities,

00:05:20.176 --> 00:05:24.595
make strategy or make strategic recommendations?

00:05:24.595 --> 00:05:26.980
And what about people who are able

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.558
to look at the financials of your business,

00:05:29.558 --> 00:05:33.202
understand the story that the financials tell,